<div class="interactive-workflow" data-interactive-tabs>
  <div class="tab-nav" role="tablist" aria-label="Workflow stages">
    <button id="tab-btn-discuss" class="tab-btn is-active" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="tab-panel-discuss" tabindex="0" data-tab-target="tab-panel-discuss">
      <strong>1. Message in Thread</strong>
      <span>People align before running AI</span>
    </button>
    <button id="tab-btn-run" class="tab-btn" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="tab-panel-run" tabindex="-1" data-tab-target="tab-panel-run">
      <strong>2. Ask AI (Chat or Work)</strong>
      <span>Pick a Worker and workflow preset</span>
    </button>
    <button id="tab-btn-coordinate" class="tab-btn" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="tab-panel-coordinate" tabindex="-1" data-tab-target="tab-panel-coordinate">
      <strong>3. Execute on Workspace</strong>
      <span>Route each step to an authorized Worker</span>
    </button>
    <button id="tab-btn-verify" class="tab-btn" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="tab-panel-verify" tabindex="-1" data-tab-target="tab-panel-verify">
      <strong>4. Inspect in Thread</strong>
      <span>Review step outputs and attribution</span>
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="tab-content">
    <div id="tab-panel-discuss" class="tab-panel is-active" data-tab-panel="tab-panel-discuss" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-btn-discuss" tabindex="0">
      <div class="run-card__header"><span>Message Mode</span><strong>Authentication token refresh</strong></div>
      <div class="conversation-preview">
        <p><strong>Alex</strong><span>The refresh flow still has a race condition when two tabs wake simultaneously.</span></p>
        <p><strong>Vitalii</strong><span>Agreed. Let's run Implement on the Workspace to fix it and verify with tests.</span></p>
      </div>
      <p>Human discussion in <strong>Message</strong> mode is side-effect free. Your group can talk through goals and constraints in the Thread before starting an AI run.</p>
    </div>

    <div id="tab-panel-run" class="tab-panel" data-tab-panel="tab-panel-run" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-btn-run" tabindex="0" hidden>
      <div class="run-card__header"><span>Ask AI Mode</span><strong>Fix refresh race and add regression coverage</strong></div>
      <div class="work-request-preview">
        <span>Workflow Preset</span><strong>Implement (Plan → Implement → Test → Verify)</strong>
        <span>Authorized Workspace</span><strong>Vitalii's MacBook Pro</strong>
        <button type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">Ask AI</button>
      </div>
      <p>Switching the composer to <strong>Ask AI</strong> lets you choose <strong>Chat</strong> for a direct answer or a structured workflow: <strong>Work</strong>, <strong>Research</strong>, or <strong>Implement</strong>.</p>
    </div>

    <div id="tab-panel-coordinate" class="tab-panel" data-tab-panel="tab-panel-coordinate" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-btn-coordinate" tabindex="0" hidden>
      <div class="run-card__header"><span>Execution</span><strong>Step-by-step Worker assignment</strong></div>
      <div class="coordination-preview">
        <div><span>Plan</span><strong>Claude (claude-code)</strong></div>
        <div><span>Implement</span><strong>ChatGPT (chatgpt-codex)</strong></div>
        <div><span>Test</span><strong>Workspace CLI Engine</strong></div>
        <div><span>Verify</span><strong>Google Gemini</strong></div>
      </div>
      <p>Syntila Cloud schedules each step onto an authorized Workspace. The local CLI Worker Engine runs the provider CLI under an exclusive Thread mutation lease while credentials stay on that host.</p>
    </div>

    <div id="tab-panel-verify" class="tab-panel" data-tab-panel="tab-panel-verify" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-btn-verify" tabindex="0" hidden>
      <div class="run-card__header"><span>Thread Record</span><strong>Workflow completed with verification</strong></div>
      <div class="evidence-preview">
        <span>✓ Plan &amp; implementation recorded</span>
        <span>✓ Test step output captured</span>
        <span>✓ Independent verification step</span>
        <span>✓ Full Worker &amp; model attribution</span>
      </div>
      <p>Every step output, status transition, and verification summary is recorded in the shared Thread so everyone in the Space can inspect what happened and continue the conversation.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
